- `#queue`: PriorityQueue of job entries.
- `#running`: Set of running jobs (occupied slots).
- `#waiting`: Set of jobs waiting for backoff.
- `#busyKeys`: Set of keys currently in use (running or waiting).
- `#seq`: monotonically increasing arrival counter.
